  unitName: Sacred Flora Mordlim
  unitId: 30947
  unitNumber: 1612
  description: Given her staggering power, scholars have advanced many theoretical
    explanations for Mordlim's interest in otherworldly technologies. One such theory
    holds that Mordlim was originally a comparatively weak Earth spirit that used
    otherworldly technologies to survive in a brutal environment. If this theory
    is accurate, and had Mordlim devoted her energies toward her own kind and Ishgria's
    environment, she likely would have restored life to that war-torn land and aided
    those as powerless as she had once been.
  summonDesc: The land ravaged by war, the meek persecuted... I will use all of the
    wisdom I have gained to spare them from this fate!
  fusionDesc: You...weaklings...<br>This is how you gain strength, then. Human ingenuity
    is a remarkable thing.
  evoDesc: Even a mere blade of grass lives as we do. My dream is of a world where
    even the lowest are never trampled underfoot!
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
